    "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ce/Pferdeegel_Haemopis_sanguisuga.jpg" page="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pferdeegel_Haemopis_sanguisuga.jpg" author="Holger Krisp" license="CC BY 4.0" note="Horse leech stretched out, from above"
